# ─── The line this repo draws ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# TRACKED:   declarative configuration + things I authored myself.
# UNTRACKED: everything pi generates, caches, or accumulates as data.
# See docs/BOUNDARY.md for the reasoning.
#
# Note: plugin-installed skills and agents are never copied into this repo in
# the first place (sync.sh uses manifests/my-skills.txt as an allowlist), so
# they need no ignore rules here.

# --- secrets: never, under any circumstance ---
auth.json
**/auth.json
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# --- data: memory, sessions, history (deliberately not versioned for now) ---
memory/
sessions/
projects-memory/
pi-hermes-memory/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite*
*.bak
*.bak-*

# --- regenerable / machine-specific state ---
cache/
node_modules/
models-store.json
mcp-cache.json
run-history.jsonl
trust.json

# --- tool-managed files (reinstalling the tool rewrites them) ---
extensions/herdr-agent-state.ts

# --- os noise ---
.DS_Store
